{
  "id": "ROM.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "ROM",
  "reference": "Röm 11",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyuth Kuɔth kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kɔ̱a̱c lɔaac",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ thiec i̱, ci Kuoth nɛɛkɛ ɣer? /Cɛ dee a jɛn! Ɣän puɔ̱nydä lapä raan I-thɛ-rɛl mi kuɛ̈ɛ̈ A-bɛ-ram, thok duëël Ben-ya-min. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Ken Kuoth nɛɛkɛ tëë cɛ mɛk ni wal ɣer. Kui̱c yɛn min ci ruac Kuɔth ɛ lar kɛ kui̱ E-li-yaa, ɛn ɣöö cɛ Kuoth pal kɛ kui̱ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "1 Kua̱r 19:10.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kuäär ni Kuoth, ci kɛn gööku näk, ci kɛn yi̱kniku däk, ci duɔth ni ɣän kärɔa, kä go̱o̱r kɛn näkdä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ci Kuoth ɛ loc i̱di? Cuɛ wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "1 Kua̱r 19:18.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Cä rɔɔdä ka̱p nɛy ti bathdɔɔri da̱ŋ bärɔw ti /ka̱n rɔ̱ ka̱m mua̱a̱l kɛ kuoth Baal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ bä, kɛ jɛn gua̱a̱th ɛmɛ, ɛ te duɔth nath thi̱n, ti ca kuany kɛ puɔ̱th baaŋ Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi kuanyɛ kɛ kɛ puɔ̱th baaŋ, /cɛ kɛ kuany kɛ lätkiɛn. Kɛ ɣöö mi ɛ lätkiɛn /ci puɔ̱th baaŋ Kuɔth dee lɛ ŋot ala puɔ̱th baaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛŋu mi ci tuɔɔk? /Ken I-thɛ-rɛl min go̱o̱rɛ jek. Ci nɛy tin ca kuany ɛ jek, kä cua wuɔ̱th nɛɛni tin kɔ̱ŋ jakä bum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ce̱tkɛ min ca gɔ̱r i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ica 29:10.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dee nɛy diaal kään?",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ, cua̱ thiec i̱, min cikɛ kɔ̱th kɔ̱thikä kɛn ji̱ Juudh ɛ tëth mi cikɛ nor? /Cɛ dee a jɛn! Kä kɛ ɣöö cikɛ duer ci ka̱n ben kä Jur kɛ ɣöö bɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl jakä tekɛ tiɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ, duer ji̱ Juudh no̱ŋɛ ni ɣɔw puɔ̱th mi di̱i̱t, kä thöliɛn no̱ŋɛ ni Jur puɔ̱th mi di̱i̱t, kä bi puɔ̱th kulɛ ni̱n di mi wä ji̱ Juudh diaal rɔ̱ wä mat!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ka̱n Juri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ ruacä kɛ yɛn Jur. Ce̱tnikɛ mɔ ɛ ɣän jääk kä Jur, jakä la̱tdä kä di̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö bä nɛɛkä jakä tekɛ tiɛɛl, kä bi tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn cu kään. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ɣeriɛn lotdɛ ni loc maarä kɛ ɣɔw, kä nhökdiɛn lotdɛ ni tëk li̱eth! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi ca tha̱a̱ŋ wacä min nhiam thöp ala muc mi rɛl rɔ, bi wac kɛɛliw rɔ rɛl, kä mi rɛl cio̱o̱k jiaath rɔ, bi kaar rɔ rɛl bä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ca tha̱a̱ŋ kari jiaath Ɔ-lip to̱l kä piny, kä ca kaar jiaath Ɔ-lip mi te dɔɔr mat kɛ jɛ kɛɛl. Yɛn jur ce̱t yɛn kɛ jiath Ɔ-lip in te dɔɔr. Kä täämɛ ci buɔ̱m teekä yieekä nyuak kɛ ji̱ Juudh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cu rɔ liak kɛ kaar. Mi wi̱i̱ rɔ wä liak, tit ɛ ɛn ɣöö /ciɛ ji̱n ɛnɔ luäk cio̱o̱k jiathɔ, duundɛ ɣöö ɛ cio̱o̱k ɛnɔ luäk ji̱ mɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi wee i̱, “Ca kar töl kä piny kɛ ɣöö bä gua̱a̱th jek.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɔmɔ ɛ thuɔ̱k. Ca kɛ töl kä piny kɛ thil ŋäthädiɛn, kä ji̱n cuŋi a bum kɛ ŋa̱th kärɔa. Kɛ ɣöö inɔ /cu bia̱ gua̱n liakä, cuŋni kɛ dual. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ mi /ken Kuoth kar tin bä puɔ̱ny jiaath ɛmɔ päl, kä dɔ̱ŋ /cɛ ji̱ bi päl bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ, nɛn gɔɔy lɔaac Kuɔth kɛnɛ ŋɛ̈nydɛ, ŋɛ̈ny kɛ kui̱ nɛɛni tin ci thöl, kä gɔɔy lɔaac Kuɔth kɛ ji̱, bɛ ji̱ jak kä te rɛy gɔɔyä lɔaacdɛ, kiɛ bɛ ji̱ tɛ̈m raar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä a cäŋɛ nɛy tin kɔ̱kiɛn, mi /ci kɛn ŋot kɛ buɔ̱m kɛ ciaaŋdiɛn mi thil ŋa̱th, ba kɛ piɛth thi̱n, kɛ ɣöö te Kuoth kɛ lua̱ŋ kɛ ɣöö bɛ kɛ nyɔk kɛ pith thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö mi ca ji̱ tɛ̈m kä kä jiath Ɔ-lip mi ci do̱ny dɔɔr, kä ca ji̱ piɛth jiath Ɔ-lip mi ci do̱ny rɛy kakä min gua̱c kɛ ciaŋ pi̱thä, bɛ kulɛ thia̱k i̱di ɛn ɣöö ba kar tin thuɔ̱k nyɔk kɛ pith jiathdiɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ba ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal kän",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
